# Diagram fences: ```mermaid draws its code in a bordered panel under it
# while the caret is in it, and only the drawing once the caret leaves.
# A broken diagram says what is wrong, as Typora words it, and waves red
# under the code at fault while the caret is off its line; ```flow and
# ```sequence are drawn too.
type ```mermaid\ngraph TD\nA-->B
wait 2000
check view.itemAt(0).body.diagramFence && !view.itemAt(0).body.folded
check view.itemAt(0).body.diagramView.good !== "" && view.itemAt(0).body.diagramView.error === ""
shot @DIR@/open.png
key Down
type after
wait 300
check view.itemAt(0).body.folded && view.itemAt(0).body.height > 100
shot @DIR@/folded.png
caret 0 13
type  -->
wait 2000
check view.itemAt(0).body.diagramView.error.indexOf("ERROR: [Mermaid] ") === 0
check view.itemAt(0).body.diagramView.good === ""
check view.itemAt(0).body.diagramView.mark !== "[]" && view.itemAt(0).body.codeHighlighter.errors === "[]"
caret 0 2
check view.itemAt(0).body.codeHighlighter.errors === view.itemAt(0).body.diagramView.mark
shot @DIR@/error.png
caret 0 17
key BackSpace BackSpace BackSpace BackSpace
key Ctrl+End
type \n```flow\nst=>start: Go\ne=>end\nst->e
wait 2000
check view.itemAt(2).body.diagramView.good !== ""
key Down
type ```sequence\nA->B: hi
wait 2000
check view.itemAt(3).body.diagramView.good !== ""
shot @DIR@/all.png
dump @OUT@
